<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <template id="s_facodi_principles_ledger" name="FACODI Principles Ledger">
        <section class="facodi-principles-ledger" data-snippet="s_facodi_principles_ledger" data-name="FACODI Principles Ledger">
            <article class="facodi-principles-ledger__item">
                <span class="facodi-principles-ledger__index">01</span>
                <h3>Open beats locked</h3>
                <p>Start with public learning resources people can actually open, share and revisit without a paywall getting in the way.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="facodi-principles-ledger__item">
                <span class="facodi-principles-ledger__index">02</span>
                <h3>Context beats link dumps</h3>
                <p>Connect useful resources to a course, curricular unit or learning question instead of dropping isolated links into a pile.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="facodi-principles-ledger__item">
                <span class="facodi-principles-ledger__index">03</span>
                <h3>Review beats guesswork</h3>
                <p>Keep community contribution separate from publication, and make the editorial boundary visible when something is still under review.</p>
            </article>
        </section>
    </template>
</odoo>
